ce. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;The deeper you go, the higher the stakes and the bigger the payouts.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797460/extras/106dca40a89cc1a8d3decf2c3fd322f5.poster.avif?t=1753290538\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797460/extras/106dca40a89cc1a8d3decf2c3fd322f5.webm?t=1753290538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797460/extras/106dca40a89cc1a8d3decf2c3fd322f5.mp4?t=1753290538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2694\ufe0f PvP vs PvE: Choose Your Path</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're aiming for glory on the PvP leaderboards or just enjoying the game by completing PvE quests, RaceOnLife rewards both. Skill matters. Teamwork matters. But sometimes? Luck is everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Pure skill and freedom of action.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797460/extras/d74a9794d3513300c20e9c41eab05ca0.avif?t=1753290538\" data-has-big width=800 height=480 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcac Message from us</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We strive to make the game even better with your feedback. We really appreciate your constructive criticism and support as a new and ambitious team. Your input helps us grow and improve everyone's gaming experience. Don't hesitate to contact us, we would love to hear feedback from everyone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>&quot;Let's make history together!&quot;</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797460/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.poster.avif?t=1753290538\" width=736 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797460/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.webm?t=1753290538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797460/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.mp4?t=1753290538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "\ud83c\udf34RaceOnLife is a new genre multiplayer &quot;Open World Racing and Fighting&quot; game with ultra-realistic graphics, created on the Unreal Engine 5. Immerse yourself in a variety of game modes, including destructible motorcycles and cars, unique racing events and a completely new level of realism.",
