        "notes": "While our game is all about fun, freedom, and connecting with others, we also give players the ability to fully express themselves - sometimes with their fists. Fights can happen both in dedicated combat modes and across the open-world map, with visible blood and realistic action.\r\n\r\nWe do not encourage violence and strongly promote respectful, friendly gameplay. Still, the freedom we offer may lead to unpredictable - and sometimes intense - situations. Enjoy the chaos responsibly, and remember: the real win is making new allies, not enemies."
